<title>HONG KONG: Trading of China United shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of China United shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of gift packaging and property investment concern China United Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Last Friday, China United said it was holding talks to raise its stake in a 51 percent-owned subsidiary and said the purchase might be funded by issue of new shares.</p>
<p>The company shares fell HK$0.015 or 3.37 percent to end at HK$0.43 per share on Tuesday on volume of 10.99 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
